  "description": "OnBarcode .NET RDLC Reports Leitcode Barcode Generator is a C# barcode generator library to create Leitcode barcode format in RDLC reports. \nYou can easily generate Leitcode barcodes in the .NET RDLC reports web and Windows applications.\n\n.NET RDLC Reports Barcode library can be used in C#, VB.NET, ASP.NET Core, Framework, MVC, Windows Forms, WPF, console and desktop applications.\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Documents\n* How to Developer Guide : https://www.onbarcode.com/tutorial/csharp-barcode-generation.html\n* Email : support@onbarcode.com",
